1:// Experiment 1: occupancy-conditioned submit trace.
2://
3:// Logical operations are submitted one per MMIO. Each iteration pre-submits K
4:// descriptors, then records raw timing for the measured submit range:
5://
6://   default: [op 0] ... [op K-1] + [op K]
7://                         prefill     measured
8://
9://   trace-until N: [op 0] ... [op K-1] + [op K] ... [op N-1]
10://                              prefill     measured submit trace
11://
12:// Statistics are deliberately left to post-processing so plotting can choose
13:// percentiles and filters without changing the hardware runner.
14://
